{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_chen_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chen_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一鼓作氣",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chen_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5de1dc829734d78ecce644659992e2a54925f5bb59bfb10e1cbba51ebb1e6b77",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那我重複一遍，聽好，“我的志願是加入近衛局，之後，我會加入特別督察組”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我會捍衛這座城市，也會讓它變得更乾淨。那種事不會再發生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我們已經準備好進駐貧民區了，不是嗎？我們不是要出臺新的感染者居住案嗎，這不是變得比昨天更好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們已經準備好去平等善待感染者了，我們善待龍門的每一個人，無論其感染與否，因為他們都是龍門人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "我們準備好了，龍門準備好了嗎？大眾準備好了嗎？商業聯合會會投票嗎？現在我告訴近衛局我是感染者，你猜會發生什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九，你是不是從一開始就知道，我做的事不會成功？\n那麼，你為什麼要幫助我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......陳......陳警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "真難得啊，向來對工作一絲不苟的陳警司也會在這種地方偷懶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "詩懷雅，你現在應該在貧民區外圍待命才對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "那邊準備得差不多了，我是來喊你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "對講機的信號範圍能覆蓋到貧民區。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "但是我想親眼看看你哭喪著臉的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你指什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "別裝了，陳暉潔，九是你的後盾，新的感染者居住案是你今年最上心的事之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "而現在，九突然辭職，法案沒有通過，你說我想看什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "九不是我的後盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "魏總督也不是，嗯哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "一個“毫無背景”加入近衛局兩年不到的新人，不僅刷新了加入特別督察組的最快記錄，還成為了新的感染者居住案的有力推動者之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "看來在入組測驗上輸給我這件事，比我想像的還讓你記恨，施懷雅家的大小姐，心眼也不過如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "嘁，技不如人，這我認了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "不過，我第一次在近衛局以外的地方聽到你的名字竟然是在一場宴會上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "陳暉潔小姐，你知道為什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "因為那份法案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "他們說，你自以為有魏總督和九做後盾，就覺得自己好像能做到什麼事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "然後他們碰了碰杯，一臉自得地說了句“自不量力”，接著聊別的去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......自不量力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "對，你為這件事的不停奔走在他們眼裡就是這種程度的東西，他們甚至沒有再提到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "而如果你現在還打算在這裡偷懶，那我可以告訴你，你另一件準備許久的事——近衛局入駐貧民區，也做不成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "幾支隊伍都準備好了，九現在不在，你是主導者，所有人都在等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我還不用你來教我做事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你最好不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "Missy，為什麼你不把你當時走上去把手裡的酒澆在那兩個人頭上的事也一起說了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我又不是來安慰她，或者和她同仇敵愾的，我是來嘲笑她的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "而且她是今天行動的負責人，她不動起來，難道要我去指揮嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但你至少覺得她沒做錯，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我從小呢，也見過不少在我祖父面前，擺出一副自己想要做大事的樣子的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "不過他們大多只是裝的，想騙點錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那位想必慧眼如炬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "他老人家是不是慧眼如炬我不知道，但托他的福，我可擅長分辨那種只知道裝腔作勢的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那老陳呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "正蠢材。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，無法反駁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "走吧，今天要做的事可有不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "text": "陳警司，今天是近衛局駐貧民區辦事處成立的大好日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "text": "可以說一下您現在的心情嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "無可奉告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "走開走開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "text": "哎，你怎麼推人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "哎，不知道哪裡鑽出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不是說了，不允許記者靠近嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "陳警司，我們趕了。進駐貧民區這麼大陣仗的事，哪裡趕得走這些蒼蠅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員B",
      "text": "都在等著我們出醜呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員B",
      "text": "呃，沒有說您這個決策有問題，只是，九忽然辭職，您又是感染者居住案的推動者之一，難免有些風口浪尖的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......讓他們拍吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "列隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員們",
      "text": "到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "一直以來，貧民區對於近衛局來說，都是塊難啃的骨頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "貧民區藏汙納垢，貧民區有感染者，貧民區是法外之地......貧民區是龍門的一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道你們之中有許多人對於進駐貧民區也不理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員們",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但我要說，之所以形成這種狀況，我們這些生活在市區的人需要承擔起一部分責任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是我們沒有將貧民區當作龍門的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "而今天，以及未來，我們要做的，就是用我們的行動去告訴這裡的人，他們也是龍門的一分子，龍門對他們一視同仁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "明白了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員們",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "別的不說，我們對貧民區的人有沒有一視同仁我是不知道，有些人對我們還是挺一視同仁的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不管我們近衛局在哪裡做什麼，都會想來給我們搞點麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "而今天呢，是咱們在貧民區“開張大吉”的日子，肯定會有些看不慣我們的人來送禮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "大傢伙也不用想太多，我們兵來將擋水來土掩就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "完事了之後，今晚我請客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "吃啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "大排檔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員們",
      "text": "切......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你們要是能說動老陳也掏腰包，那就是另一回事了，對吧，老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員B",
      "text": "陳警司，怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，這就對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陳警司，阿發在我們手上，不想他死的話，就麻煩你一個人走一趟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不愧是陳警司，痛快人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "發給你了，半個小時內你如果沒有出現，阿發的命就難保了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳，怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "麻煩這就來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我跟你一起去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不用，我一個人應付得來，指揮權暫時交給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "各位，準備開始掃除了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員們",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我來了，一個人，沒別人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "阿發，你只有一個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "對唔住，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......你騙我，阿發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "鐵錨幫的老大逼我在這裡把你炸死，我不做，我的老母就得死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "他們知道你是對這件事最上心的人，只要把你解決，這件事就成不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你還沒按下起爆鍵，我就會砍下你的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "別做蠢事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "遙控器不在我手上，要是我死了，外面的人也會引爆炸藥，不要輕舉妄動的人是你，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......不要怨我，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "鬼姐把我介紹給你，我知道你是好人，有些貧民區的人也知道，但別人不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "你知道一些盤踞在貧民區的大佬不會坐視近衛局進駐貧民區。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "但你不知道，就算是生活在貧民區的普通人，也沒有多少真的相信近衛局進駐貧民區是為了做好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "他們只覺得自己最後的一點自由都要沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我沒想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我知道你不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "但他們不這麼想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我求你，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "你是個好人，我不想你出事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "你發個消息，讓那些阿sir都散了，別來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "你們現在這樣進駐貧民區，沒好下場的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "就算撐過了今天，也撐不過明天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "那些大佬沒人性的，他們會用你接受不了的法子把近衛局趕走的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你覺得......我會答應？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我當初也跟了鬼姐這麼久，我想做個好人，陳警司！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "不要逼我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "爆炸？我沒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "嘖，難道是鐵錨幫？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司，你當心，是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司，陳警司？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "還有氣，陳警司這是昏過去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "一定是為了保護我受了傷。怎麼辦，要是陳警司真在這裡出事，我怎麼向鬼姐交代......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "交代？今天你和她都得給我死在這。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "你們，你們是鐵錨幫的......不是說這件事讓我來做嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "我們老大不放心你，就讓我們來看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "說好的等她進來就把她炸死呢，你還在這和她聊上了，怎麼個意思，嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司沒那麼好騙，我在引誘她到一定能炸死她的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "是嗎？那我隨便引爆一下怎麼就把她炸倒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "去，看看死了沒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小弟",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "你作死啊，李寶發，別忘了你老母還在我們手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小弟",
      "text": "大哥，只是昏過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "沒死？也行，帶回去讓老大處置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小弟",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "誰，敢動鐵錨幫的人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "光天化日之下，要謀害龍門近衛局特別督察組的人，你們膽子也真不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "傳出去，別人是不是以為鼠王管不住他的人了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "林小姐......！這、這是個誤會，我們老大只是想請陳警司去喝杯茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那回去告訴深哥，說鼠王也請陳警司，深哥想請，去問鼠王請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我把你們都放倒後，親自去和深哥說也可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "我知道了，我知道了，您請，您請！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者打手",
      "text": "走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "林小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你母親很安全，放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "謝謝您！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "但是陳警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你不用管，鼠王確實要我帶她過去，只是我也沒想到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "真是狼狽，陳暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "......你是要回去當警察？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "警察？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哇。我一直覺得陳陳你看上去就是那種，會狠狠地揍歹徒一頓的人。我沒看錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "別下結論。但警察......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "做警察也不壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "警察應該會手握更多線索吧，當年的事，現在的事......不用再靠我那個一臉老謀深算樣的舅舅了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "她居然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "唉，這也是命數，我已經通知魏彥吾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "爸，真要把這個麻煩保下來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "即使她不是魏彥吾的侄女，光憑她這兩年在貧民區做的事，我也會保下她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "但她根本不知道自己在做什麼，她以為這樣能讓事情變好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "她這樣做，事情不會變得更糟，反而會有變好的可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "如果我來做，我會做得更聰明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "如果你來做，你能否做得更好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "去吧，既然插手了，就幫一把近衛局的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "還有，去敲打一下阿深。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我曉得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這裡是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "林叔？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "不用驚訝，是我差人救下的你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "阿發......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "阿發沒事，他的母親也沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "謝謝您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "近衛局要進貧民區，我不出手，你怨不怨我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我明白您的立場，您願意不出手，我已經很感激了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "呵呵，龍門人都說陳暉潔不懂變通，我看，只是你不想按他們的想法變通罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......謝謝您的誇獎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果有時間的話，我也想和您多聊聊，但是現在近衛局還在執行任務，所以我先......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你不能去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "暉潔，你知道我與魏彥吾的關係，所以我喊你一聲暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "剛才那種程度的爆炸，原本不該讓你陷入昏迷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你知道為什麼你昏過去了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "因為我......當時心裡雜念太多，沒反應過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "有這個原因，但另一個原因是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你知不知道，你被感染了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "實在抱歉，陳。我沒能護住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "雖然花擋住了大多數，但還是有一些碎片飛出去了。我想......我看到有好幾塊碎片刺穿了你。趕緊去處理吧。說不定還來得及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是那時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "難怪，這段時間，我覺得有些把握不住力道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "感染礦石病帶來的身體變化，加上這段時間的心力交瘁，你早就是一個炸藥桶了，爆炸只是引爆了這個炸藥桶而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "近衛局那邊，我差人去幫忙和報信了，你不必擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "機會難得，陪我這個老人家走走吧，暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區兒童",
      "text": "陳姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "阿琳？......啊，現在是放學的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區兒童",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "今天有好好學習嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區兒童",
      "text": "嗯！陳姐姐你讓我好好學習，我聽你的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區兒童",
      "text": "我去帶弟弟吃飯了，陳姐姐下次來我家玩，我給你講我新學的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "這兩年，你用自己的薪資資助了二十多個貧民區的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "工作之餘，你也會來陪他們，教他們道理和知識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "這些孩子，大部分都被你教得不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是我應該做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "暉潔，如果沒有你這兩年在貧民區的所作所為，今天我不會見你，你永遠見不到貧民區的鼠王。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你會與我走這一道，是因為你是推動新感染者居住案的陳暉潔，你是想要讓近衛局入駐貧民區從而推動貧民區融入龍門的陳暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "而不是魏彥吾的侄女，那個得他赤霄劍術親傳，從維多利亞皇家近衛學校畢業的陳暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "無論魏彥吾怎麼想，我都會對你說一聲，你做得不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......謝謝您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "陳警司，你怎麼和鼠王老人家湊一塊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "只是陪我這個老人家散散步而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "這樣啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "對了，陳警司，你幫我帶的那個礦石病抑制藥好像真的挺有用的，我上次病發的時候吃了一點，居然感覺好多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這樣就好，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "你可千萬別說下次還幫我帶，陳警司，我還不起的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "光是你帶給我的藥我這輩子恐怕都還不起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "我省著點吃就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "哎，陳警司，我聽說那個新的感染者居住案沒通過，你別太往心裡去，其實我一開始就覺得要通過很難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "不過，不少貧民區的人都覺得你只是嘩眾取寵，找點不可能實現的事來給自己賺名聲，但我不覺得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "你幫過我，我知道你是真心的，所以你一定很難過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "我聽說今天近衛局要進駐貧民區，就想能不能見你一面和你說一聲，沒想到在這見到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "哪裡，是我謝謝你才對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區感染者",
      "text": "我等一會兒還要去工地做事，就先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "注意身體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "貧民區接受過你恩惠的感染者也有不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "他們的生活要比其他感染者好一些，但好得有限。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "所以我才想要從根本上去改變一些東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "暉潔，你覺得龍門是不是一座好城市？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "相比我知道的其他地方，這裡算好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但我不願意說它好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "因為你覺得可以更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我看著你的時候，我也覺得可以更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但陳暉潔只有一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "您也想勸我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "有什麼可勸的，你的路是你自己的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "只不過，你的路，不是龍門近衛局的路，不是魏彥吾的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你能讓別人相信你陳暉潔是個想要善待感染者的好人，可怎麼讓他們相信，堂堂施懷雅家族的大小姐是和你一樣的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "即便是和我有緣的星熊，我也無法替她做擔保，更不必說你手下的警員們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "當你說，你想要從根本上改變什麼的時候，你是無法只靠自己的力量達成的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你要如何說服別人相信你所代表的東西，你要如何讓別人相信你所代表的東西有你想像的力量，暉潔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "這邊來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "阿發？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我......對不起，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "我害了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不怪你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "哎，幸好你沒事，差點我就沒臉去見鬼姐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你沒事，我也放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "但是，陳警司，我對你說的那些話，都是真心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "近衛局現在不該進來，來了也沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "貧民區還沒到能見光的時候，現在還太早了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "鼠王，您這是什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "很簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "不管怎麼說，他確實受到鐵錨幫的指使，傷了暉潔你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "他在你不知道的地方也和好幾個幫派有些關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "把他帶走，你能順藤摸瓜揪出不少東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但我畢竟不能讓近衛局的人從我眼皮子底下將人帶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "否則，我在其他老朋友面前也不好抬頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "所以，我需要你做出選擇，暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你要帶走阿發，那麼今日你與我這一道，就當沒有發生過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你繼續試試走你的陽關道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "如果你不帶走阿發，你可以離開近衛局，來我手下做事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我的女兒，你可能還記得，雨霞，身邊一直缺個同齡又說得上話的好幫手，她見到你肯定很高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "林雨霞......倒是未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你不必擔心，魏彥吾那邊，我去與他說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "您......這是在招攬我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "魏彥吾豈會同意一個感染者留在近衛局？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你能做的選擇，並不多，暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "報告魏長官，我所指的是十年前龍門遭到外部勢力侵入，市民遭到綁架並自此失蹤的事件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我加入近衛局後，會進一步推動龍門對失蹤人口的調查和追蹤工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "陳......你不知道你在說什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "報告長官，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我不會反對的。那就這樣吧，若你做不下去，就告訴我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "陳警司，你想在近衛局幹幾年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不會帶走阿發，他沒想害我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民區居民",
      "text": "陳警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但今日我與您這一道，就當沒發生過吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "您不用騙我，既然您救下我，魏彥吾想必已經知道了我感染這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "只是我向不向他坦白的區別罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "呵呵，我與魏彥吾之間，倒也沒有你想像的那樣毫無保留。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "只不過，這件事，確實不好隱瞞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不知道他會怎麼想，如果我還能留在近衛局，我會繼續做我該做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果不能，我會尋找別的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我相信，在您的身邊也能做到許多事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但這不適合我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "不必向我道歉，暉潔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你還不打算放棄，我不會說這很好，因為你選的是一條看不到未來的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但你還年輕，你還有嘗試的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳，你沒事吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "星熊？我沒事，只是出了點小狀況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行，看來Missy那個朋友沒騙我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我們這邊差不多搞定了，不過下一步要怎麼做......還得你來判斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我這就過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "今天謝謝您，林叔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "不必謝我，要謝，就謝你自己吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "魏彥吾，你看，她和你當年簡直是一個模子裡刻出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "這不是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "現在你開始說這不是好事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我很好奇，一個感染者，能不能治理一座城市？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "如果她想，那她就應當能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "有些話應該你來說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "如果我來說，她未必聽得真切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "這可不像一個聽到侄女被感染後，立刻推掉所有安排趕過來的長輩會說的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你總是這樣，她只會愈發不理解你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "她不理解的不是我，而是枷鎖、規則。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "而她既然沒有斬斷的力量，那她就永遠無需理解我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但你期望她有，並在為她打造最鋒利的劍，一柄叫作龍門的劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我們從那些年走過來，並笑到了最後，林舸瑞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "但我們又有誰希望有人重蹈我們的覆轍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我教她劍術，但最終，出劍的是她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "她必須靠自己去理解如何運用自己手上的東西，只有這樣，我使的雲裂之劍，與她最後能領悟的雲裂，才能不是同一劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "她不應當與我遞出同一劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "命數，都是命數啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我們拼了命拿到手上的好東西，還沒怎麼享受，就被人給毀得七七八八。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你給暉潔準備了這片大地上最好的禮物，她的生命卻開始倒計時了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "大少爺，你說，老天爺難道就真的見不得人好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "老天爺怎麼想，與我無關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "但龍門會越來越好，這是我現今唯一能做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你看，我就說，你們兩個啊，簡直是一個模子裡刻出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在近衛局第一次嘗試進駐貧民區時，陳借機雷霆出擊，掃除了窩藏在貧民區內的數個黑惡勢力。\n陳憑藉著這份功績，升任特別督察組組長。\n但就在所有人都以為近衛局要在貧民區站穩腳跟時，陳卻出人意料地宣佈，近衛局將從貧民區撤出。\n大部分人認為，進駐貧民區本就是她為後續的雷霆行動走的一步險棋。\n半年後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "陳警司呢？有她的信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員B",
      "text": "剛泡了杯咖啡回辦公室了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "她不會又沒回宿舍吧，這也太拼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員B",
      "text": "可不是，感覺自從半年前的那次行動後，陳警司就把自己逼得更緊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "哎，真怕她這樣把自己身體搞垮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "在說什麼悄悄話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警員A",
      "text": "啊，陳警司，沒什麼，這裡有你的信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "信？讓我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（九寄來的？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（成為感染者後，她......和整合運動搭上了關係？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（上面還有她留的特別聯絡號碼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（整合運動......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "喂......是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "好久不見，陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
